			"notes": "v2.24.36.7\nmajor: 2 minor:24 patch:36 hotfix:7\n\n1.  added cucumber plant\n\n2.  added salt\n\n3.  added cucumber\n\n4.  added looting tables for the cucumber plant\n\n5.  added salt ore\n\n6.  fix hot hands\n\n7.  added a biome called emerald-rich salt mines\n\n8.  added looting tables for salt ore, tungsten ore\n\n9.  changed the name of salty ore to salt ore along with its respective smelting recipes\n\n10. changed tungsten tool set registry names so a new world is advisable or doesn't update\n\n11. added boss named the creator it is a warden-ish style boss best to avoid until late game\n\n12. updated boss type to undead\n\n13. debuff heal effect on armor so the absorption is not covering a whole 8th of the screen\n\n14. (DEV): added tags for armor/items in more detail on GitHub (source button)\n\n15. changed registry name for light armor, cobblestone armor, dripstone armor\n\n16. fixed cucumber plant spawning way too much on normal worlds\n\n17. updated wood log armor texture\n\n18. fixed tungsten and other armor sets not having crafting recipes along with some tools\n\n19. removed beacon traid for armoring villager\n\n20. added crafting recipe to luminism ingot\n\n21. touched up some of the textures\n\n## What's Changed\n* 1.18.2 beta by @pokeyt59 in https://github.com/pokeyt59/colab_v2/pull/4\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pokeyt59/colab_v2/compare/tested-pre-release-v2.24.35.7...tested-release-v2.24.36.7"
