			"notes": "a LOT happened\nv2.22.33.6 beta pt1\n\nmajor:2 minor:22 patch:33 hotfix:6\n\n1. added cucumber plant\n\n2. added salt\n\n3. added cucumber\n\n4. added looting tables for the cucumber plant\n\n5. added salt ore\n\n6. fix hot hands\n\n7. added a biome called emerald-rich salt mines\n\n8. added looting tables for salt ore, tungsten ore\n\n9. changed the name of salty ore to salt ore along with its respective smelting recipes\n\n10. changed tungsten tool set registry names so a new world is advisable or don't update\n----------pt2 for git hub------------------------------------\n\n11. the added boss named the creator is a warden-ish style boss best to avoid until late game\n\n12. updated boss type to undead\n\n13. added projectile launcher from rafradek_tf2_weapons-1.12.2-1.6.1 since the mod seems to have been abandoned and I am a fan of team fortress 2 myself\n\n14. added syringe\n----------pt3 for git hub------------------------------------\n\n15. fixed crusader's crossbow texture coming out as a missing dev texture\n\n16. some balances\n----------pt4 for git hub------------------------------------\n17. removed crusaders crossbow as it was causing too many bugs and we aren't trying to make this mod tf2\n----------v2.24.34.7 pt1 for git hub------------------------------------\nv2.24.34.7\nmajor: 2 minor:24 patch:34 hotfix:7\n1. debuff heal effect on armor so the absorption is not covering a whole 8th of the screen\n\n2. removed model for crossbow along with projectiles\n\n3. added tags with the namespaces: heavy_armor_class, heavy_tools_class,\n\n4. changed registry name for light armor, cobblestone armor, and dripstone armor (along with the crafting registry names for the armor)\n----------v2.24.34.7 pt2 for git hub------------------------------------\n5. fixed Extention build errors\n\n6. fixed cucumber plant spawning way too much on normal worlds\n\n7. updated wood log armor texture\n\n## What's Changed\n* 1.18.2 beta official merge v2 by @pokeyt59 in https://github.com/pokeyt59/colab_v2/pull/2\n* 1.18.2 beta to realize stuff bust by @pokeyt59 in https://github.com/pokeyt59/colab_v2/pull/3\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pokeyt59/colab_v2/compare/tested-pre-release-v2.20.31.5...untested-pre-release-v2.24.35.7"
